+# Memory delegation milestone: md-milestone-20261025
+
+Preserves the Scudo Secondary delegation integration and benchmark helpers.
+The unified implementation is in the companion memory-delegation-backend repo;
+checkout its matching tag and set SCUDO_DELEGATION_BACKEND_DIR for CMake as
+needed. scudo_backend.cpp and scudo_delegation.cpp include maintained Backend
+sources; scudo_delegation.h forwards to the maintained adapter declarations.
+
+Android benchmark builds overlay both maintained adapter files into staging.
+The captured build uses NDK r26/API 34, ThinLTO/native TLS, secondary stats off,
+and no trace/profiling instrumentation. Test evidence, binary IDs, jemalloc
+source patch and kernel-image provenance limits are in Backend milestones/20261025/.
diff --git a/compiler-rt/lib/scudo/standalone/TEST.md b/compiler-rt/lib/scudo/standalone/TEST.md
